{
  "abstract": "Cross sections for e+e\u2212\u2192hadrons,\u00a0e+e\u2212,\u00a0and\u00a0\u03bc+\u03bc\u2212 near 3684 MeV are presented. The \u03c8(3684) resonance is established as having the assignment JPC=1\u2212\u2212. The mass is 3684 \u00b1 5 MeV. The partial width for decay to electrons is \u0393e=2.1\u00b10.3 keV and the total width is \u0393=228\u00b156 keV.",
